+  // LOCAL PATCH - MCLA (0817): upload_merge / upload_skip_same / upload_census (src/graphics/d3d12/shared_memory.cpp).
+  // The last copy recorded, which the next one may be made a part of (the same CopyBufferRegion, longer): it must be
